{"version":1,"content":"<p>在今日開幕的2026廣州車展上，<strong>全新梅賽德斯-奔馳純電GLC SUV正式推出星鉑版、暉銀版及皓雅版三款車型，官方售價26.99萬至36.22萬元，入門車型限時專享價25.49萬元起。</strong>GLC 300 L皓雅版售價26.99萬元，限時專享價25.49萬元；GLC 350 L 4MATIC暉銀版售價29.99萬元；GLC 400 L 4MATIC星鉑版售價36.22萬元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588204.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:03:52.157948+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:40:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_hash":"2bfc2247aa91a9dc9d8deda8155c2514489462b63fa778a8fd2585969525cd88","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}